  id:"whiteriverco", name:"White River", color:"#1f6f8b",
  state:"CO", region:"colorado", gauges:["whiteriverCoalCreek","whiteriverMeeker","whiteriverMeeker2","whiteriverWhiteRiver","whiteriverWhiteRiver2","whiteriverBoiseCreek"], primaryGauge:"whiteriverWhiteRiver2",
  geom:"osm",   // OpenStreetMap channel, clipped to the state with park water removed — don't re-snap
  parkRegsSrc:"colorado",
  parkRegs:"Maps: pages 33, 34<br><b>From the confluence of the North and South Forks of the White River downstream to the Colo. 13 Bridge below Meeker (excluding the Sleepy Cat easement and the Meeker Pasture State Wildlife Area):</b><br>• Bag and possession limit for trout is 2.<br><b>On the Sleepy Cat easement and Meeker Pasture State Wildlife Area east of Meeker:</b><br>• Artificial flies and lures only.<br>• Trout must be returned to water immediately.<br><b>From the confluence of the North and South Forks of the White River downstream to Kenney Reservoir:</b><br>• No bag or possession limit for channel catfish, largemouth bass, smallmouth bass, northern pike, walleye, green sunfish, blue gill, bullhead, yellow perch or crappie.<br><b>From Taylor Draw Dam downstream 400 yards:</b><br>• Fishing prohibited as posted.<br><b>From Taylor Draw Dam downstream to the state line:</b><br>• No bag or possession limit for channel catfish, largemouth bass, smallmouth bass, northern pike, walleye, green sunfish, blue gill, bullhead, yellow perch or crappie.<br><br><b>Colorado statewide limits</b> — trout, arctic char, grayling, salmon and mountain whitefish (except kokanee), in aggregate: 4 daily bag, 8 possession; trout include brook, brown, cutbow, cutthroat, golden, lake, rainbow, splake and tiger trout. Brook trout 8 inches long or less: 10 daily, 10 possession, in addition to the trout limit. Greenback cutthroat trout may not be taken and must be returned to the water immediately.",
  goodFlow:null, // TODO: set {min:___,max:___} (CFS) for YOUR good-flow range on this river
  blurb:"About 200.6 km of trout water mapped in Colorado.",
