  parkRegs:"<i>Salmon and steelhead water.</i> This river is listed in CDFW's 2026 anadromous-water regulations, <b>§7.40(b)(43)</b>, with reach-by-reach seasons, barbless-hook rules and hatchery-only harvest limits that change through the year. Those tables are reproduced here only by reference — read that entry in the current booklet before you fish.<br><br><b>California statewide stream rule</b> (§5.85) — open the last Saturday in April through November 15 with a five-trout daily bag and ten-trout possession limit, no gear restrictions. From November 16 through the Friday preceding the last Saturday in April, a zero-trout bag limit applies and only artificial lures with barbless hooks may be used; trout must be released unharmed and should not be removed from the water.",
