  parkRegs:"<b>Golden Trout Wilderness Area (Tulare Co.), excluding the main stem Kern River (see subsection 7.50(b)(69), and the Tule River drainage (See subsection 7.50(b)(154)).</b><br>• All year. Only artificial lures may be used. <i>Bag: 2 trout</i><br><br><b>California statewide stream rule</b> (§5.85) — open the last Saturday in April through November 15 with a five-trout daily bag and ten-trout possession limit, no gear restrictions. From November 16 through the Friday preceding the last Saturday in April, a zero-trout bag limit applies and only artificial lures with barbless hooks may be used; trout must be released unharmed and should not be removed from the water.",
